  "description": "Tacos are tasty, but this Korean spin on quesadillas is even better. Savory scallion pancakes are loaded with two types of cheese and heaps of spicy-sweet bulgogi beef. With all of that melted cheese, flaky pancake, and marinated steak, these bulgogi scallion pancake-adillas are impossible to resist.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 55 min to 8 hr 25 min.\n\nOptional or for serving: Cilantro, for topping\n\nOptional substitutions: beef flank steak → ribeye or sirloin\n\nNotes: Gochujang is a mild Korean chile paste. It can be found in Asian markets or ordered online.",
